    <defName>LR_Franks</defName>
    <label>Franks</label>
    <description>The Franks of the lower Rhine, Salians and Ripuarians, settled inside the Empire as federates and now its most dangerous friends. Their long-haired kings of the Merovingian house claim descent from a sea-beast, and their warriors open every battle with a volley of franciscas, the throwing axe that bears their name, and of barbed angons, before closing with axe and sword behind green shields. They keep the old gods, and they hate the Huns, against whom they will one day stand beside Rome.</description>
